    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTeam Myles O'Donoghue are delighted to bring 3 The Rise, Main Street, Blanchardstown to the market. This is a charming three bedroom bungalow, ideally positioned within Blanchardstown village, just moments from a wealth of local amenities in Blanchardstown Village and the surrounding area.\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room, and a kitchen / breakfast area. There are three well-proportioned double bedrooms, with one located to the front of the property, a second adjacent to the kitchen, and a third to the rear. A family bathroom completes the accommodation.\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it offers excellent potential for a purchaser to update and create a home tailored to their own style and requirements. Externally, the property boasts a generous rear garden, providing ample space for outdoor entertaining, gardening or future extension potential (subject to the necessary planning permission). To the front, there is a private garden.\nThere is vehicle access leading to the large rear garden which currently provides valuable off street parking facilities.\nThe Rise enjoys a superb location on Main Street, Blanchardstown, within easy walking distance of a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, cafs, restaurants and public transport links. The property is also within close proximity of the Blanchardstown Centre, Connolly Hospital, and offers excellent access to the N3, M50 and Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. There are a number of Bus Routes passing through the Village and Castleknock Train Station is within a 15 minute walk.\n\nA rare opportunity to acquire a 3 bedroom bungalow in the heart of the village.\n\nFeatures\nOff Street Parking to Rear\nGas heating\nConvenient Blanchardstown Village location\nPVC Double Glazed Windows\nLarge rear garden with development potential subject to the necessary planning permission\n\nEntrance Hall: 2.39m x 1.36m.\n\nLiving Room: 6.33m x 3.18m with feature open fireplace and timber flooring.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area: 3.49m x 2.98m with range of fitted units incorporating worktop with tiled flooring. Access to private patio / courtyard area.\n\nBathroom: 2.52m x 1.97m with WHB, white suite incorporated bath and WC. Fully Tiled.\n\nBedroom 1: 3.05m x 3.10m.\n\nBedroom 2: 3.07m x 3.12m with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3: 3.94m x 2.54m with timber flooring.\n\nPlease be advised Team Myles O'Donoghue have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings. No warranty or guarantee is given on the above, interested parties must undertake their own investigation regarding the working order of any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings.\nInformation and particulars detailed on this brochure are issued by Team Myles O'Donoghue on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of the information and particulars they do not constitute an invitation to treat, an offer or a contract of any nature whether express or implied. All descriptions dimensions, maps, plans, artist impressions, references regarding condition, permissions, licences of use or occupation, access and any details are for guidance only and may be subject to change, without prior notification. The information and particulars are provided in good faith but no intending purchaser or tenant should rely on them as statements or representations of fact and are specifically advised to undertake its own due diligence at its own expense to satisfy itself as to the accuracy and correctness of the information and particulars given. No employees of Team Myles O' Donoghue agents or affiliate companies make any warranty or representations whether express or implied with respect to the information and particulars and which are to the fullest extent permitted by law, disclaimed; furthermore, such parties accept no liability in respect of any loss suffered by any intending purchaser or tenant or any third party arising out of the information and particulars. Prices are quoted exclusive of applicable taxes such as VAT Stamp Duty (unless otherwise stated) and all negotiations are conducted on the basis that the purchaser / tenant shall be liable of any VAT Stamp Duty arising from the transaction.\n\n"
      },
